  <String Id="ForeignText" Value="LBFO (NIC ekip olu&#351;turma) ba&#351;ka bir ara&#231;la zaten y&#252;klenmi&#351;, &#246;r. Windows11LBFO. Feature Heist onu ve ekiplerini de&#287;i&#351;tirmez; LbfoAdmin onunla &#231;al&#305;&#351;&#305;r. De&#287;i&#351;tirmek i&#231;in https://github.com/motwok/FeatureHeistWin11 adresindeki tools\Migrate-FromWindows11LBFO.ps1 beti&#287;ini kullan&#305;n. LBFO'yu atlay&#305;p se&#231;ili di&#287;er paketleri y&#252;kleyin veya iptal edin." />
  <String Id="ForeignSkip" Value="LBFO'yu &amp;atla" />
  <String Id="ForeignOnly" Value="LBFO ba&#351;ka bir ara&#231;la zaten y&#252;klenmi&#351; (&#246;r. Windows11LBFO) ve se&#231;ili tek paket. De&#287;i&#351;tirmek i&#231;in https://github.com/motwok/FeatureHeistWin11 adresindeki tools\Migrate-FromWindows11LBFO.ps1 beti&#287;ini kullan&#305;n." />
